<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Feb palm oil exports 455,317t - Caleb.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Feb palm oil exports 455,317t - Caleb.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo surveyor Caleb Brett put Malaysia's February bulk palm oil exports at 455,317 tonnes against its estimate of 616,372 for January, traders said.</p>
<p>The figures include laurics and oleochemicals but exclude shipments to Singapore and exports in drum, said the traders who obtained the data by facsimile.</p>
<p>The official Palm Oil Registration and Licensing Authority put January exports at 551,665 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230-8911)</p>
</text>
